    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβαιότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>steadfastness, stability</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς οὐσίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					386a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ ἡσυχίας καὶ βεβαιότητος ζῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					503c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				735a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				790b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1100b12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>assurance, certainty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				277d
			</span></i>; <i>security, safety</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβαιότητος ἕνεκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.66
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. καὶ ἀσφάλεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Fab.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			.</div>
